id: time-to-make-the-donuts
name: Time to Make the Donuts
advancement: true
prerequisite: N/A
tpCost: 5
source: Time-Skipper
description: >
  You can use the Signature Technique Maneuver through the effects of Time-Skip instead of the Basic Attack Maneuver. That Signature Technique Maneuver must have the Time-Skipped Disadvantage.
text: >
  Time to Make the Donuts: You are able to create techniques that can be used outside of time.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –TP Cost: 5
  –Effect: You can use the Signature Technique Maneuver through the effects of Time-Skip instead of the Basic Attack Maneuver. That Signature Technique Maneuver must have the Time-Skipped Disadvantage.
